    "Is the 15,000 production hours per quarter a hard cap (total hours used across all three products in a quarter must not exceed 15,000), or is it a target that can be exceeded at some cost?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the nature of the production hour limit (hard cap vs. target)."
}

