  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "does this mean holding cost is charged on the ending inventory of each product at the end of each quarter (i.e., for Q1 through Q3, since Q4 ending inventory is fixed at 150), or is it charged on the inventory carried over between any two consecutive quarters including into Q4?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single clarification question asking for a specific policy choice between two interpretations of when holding costs are applied."
}

